  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "97597b1f-3e54-47be-a690-283c97c9b015",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Bfexplorer Dependencies and Imports\n\nLoads the required Bfexplorer assemblies and imports the namespaces needed for the notebook. This code cell adds references to \u0060BeloSoft.Data.dll\u0060, \u0060BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Domain.dll\u0060, and \u0060BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Service.Core.dll\u0060, then opens \u0060System.Collections.Generic\u0060 and the relevant \u0060BeloSoft\u0060 namespaces so later market, selection, bet, and service API code can compile."
    },
    {
      "id": "516fa470-2824-49bd-bc5c-3de4af54a417",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "fsharp",
      "source": "#I @\u0022E:\\Projects\\Bfexplorer\\Development\\Applications\\BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.App\\bin\\Debug\\net10.0-windows\u0022\r\n\r\n#r \u0022BeloSoft.Data.dll\u0022\r\n#r \u0022BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Domain.dll\u0022\r\n#r \u0022BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Service.Core.dll\u0022\r\n\r\nopen System.Collections.Generic\r\n\r\nopen BeloSoft.Data\r\nopen BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Domain\r\nopen BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Domain.Data\r\nopen BeloSoft.Bfexplorer.Service"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6bce836-68e4-444b-bb97-251a3d6eee13",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Market Display Helpers\n\nDescribes the F# market helper functions in the following code cell. \u0060showMarket\u0060 accepts a \u0060Market\u0060, prints its \u0060MarketFullName\u0060, retrieves active selections using \u0060getActiveSelections\u0060, and formats each selection with name, last traded price, and total matched volume. \u0060showBets\u0060 enumerates \u0060market.Bets\u0060, formats each bet with its associated selection name and bet details, and includes a conditional branch for the empty-bet case."
    },
    {
      "id": "7d808462-adef-44fc-839b-fd5e8c9d0dae",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "fsharp",
      "source": "let showMarket (market : Market) =\r\n    printfn \u0022%s\\n\u0022 market.MarketFullName\r\n\r\n    getActiveSelections market\r\n    |\u003E Seq.map (fun selection -\u003E sprintf \u0022%s ~ %.2f | %.2f\u0022 selection.Name selection.LastPriceTraded selection.TotalMatched)\r\n    |\u003E String.concat \u0022\\n\u0022\r\n    |\u003E printfn \u0022%s\\n\u0022\r\n\r\nlet showBets (market : Market) =   \r\n    let bets =\r\n        market.Bets\r\n        |\u003E Seq.toList\r\n        |\u003E List.map (fun bet -\u003E sprintf \u0022%s ~ %A\u0022 bet.Selection.Name bet)\r\n\r\n    if bets.IsEmpty\r\n    then\r\n        printfn \u0022No bets were placed.\\n\u0022\r\n    else\r\n        printfn \u0022All placed bets:\\n%s\\n\u0022 (bets |\u003E String.concat \u0022\\n\u0022)\r\n\r\nlet showRunningBots (market : Market) =   \r\n    let runningBots =\r\n        market.RunningBots\r\n        |\u003E Seq.toList\r\n        |\u003E List.map (fun bot -\u003E sprintf \u0022%s ~ %A\u0022 bot.Name bot.Status)\r\n\r\n    if runningBots.IsEmpty\r\n    then\r\n        printfn \u0022No bots are running.\\n\u0022\r\n    else\r\n        printfn \u0022All running bots:\\n%s\\n\u0022 (runningBots |\u003E String.concat \u0022\\n\u0022)\r\n\r\nlet execute (iBfexplorerConsole : IBfexplorerConsole) =\r\n    let market = iBfexplorerConsole.ActiveMarket        \r\n\r\n    showMarket market\r\n    showBets market\r\n    showRunningBots market"
    },
    {
      "id": "3010d7c5-bc1f-4bc1-9a31-eebeb5e0c373",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Display and Host Execution\n\nExplains the final display and execution flow. The adjacent F# code defines \u0060showMarket\u0060 and \u0060showBets\u0060 helpers for formatting market and bet data, then invokes \u0060execute\u0060 on \u0060bfexploreHost\u0060 cast to \u0060IBfexplorerConsole\u0060 to run the Bfexplorer host and print active market information and running bots."
    },
    {
      "id": "275a8785-9c9e-4e1e-bad7-d2a9bb601263",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "fsharp",
      "source": "execute (bfexplorerHost :\u003E IBfexplorerConsole)",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "Yarmouth 21st Apr - 16:45 6f Hcap\n\r\nFenlander ~ 1000.00 | 130044.94\nCaragio ~ 1.01 | 100502.18\nMy Mate Kev ~ 1000.00 | 47310.77\nDark Side Thunder ~ 1000.00 | 19156.90\nIronist ~ 610.00 | 18818.54\nBill Plumb ~ 1000.00 | 13202.57\n\r\nAll placed bets:\nFenlander ~ Back: 10.00 @ 2.72, Matched\n\r\nAll running bots:\nTake 10% profit ~ WaitingForOperation\n\r\n"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
